## P18-V01 `getConsumeStats`

- Added the Java `MqClientAdmin.getConsumeStats(address, header, timeout)`
  method mapping to `MQClientApi::mq_client_admin().get_consume_stats`, request
  code 208, nullable success body and Broker error classification.
- Added `ConsumeStats` and `OffsetWrapper` Rust DTOs with the Java public
  accessors, zero defaults, nullable MessageQueue-keyed offset table, mutable
  shared map/entry aliases, and wrapping `computeTotalDiff` /
  `computeInflightTotalDiff` arithmetic.
- Extended the invoked Java 5.5.1 fixture with method signatures, public DTO
  methods, defaults, aliases, request fields, encoded response data, computed
  totals, null-body result and Broker error. Added a Java/Rust typed-body
  fixture for this response; the typed-header oracle now uses request code 208.
- Code commit: `7375c283 feat(admin): add consume stats RPC adapter`.

